| KPI / Metric                              | Formula                                                | Why it is relevant                                                                                                                    |
| ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Conversion Rate**                       | `(Total Conversions / Total Sessions) × 100`           | Shows how effectively marketing traffic turns into conversions and allows comparison across channels, campaigns, and regions.         |
| **ROAS (Return on Ad Spend)**             | `Total Revenue / Total Marketing Spend`                | Measures how much revenue is generated for each unit of marketing spend and helps identify the most efficient channels and campaigns. |
| **CPA (Cost per Acquisition/Conversion)** | `Total Marketing Spend / Total Conversions`            | Shows the average marketing cost required to generate one conversion and helps evaluate acquisition efficiency.                       |
| **Total Revenue**                         | `SUM(Revenue)`                                         | Measures the overall financial value generated by marketing activities and can be compared across channels, regions, and campaigns.   |
| **Revenue Growth**                        | `((Revenue 2025 - Revenue 2024) / Revenue 2024) × 100` | Measures whether marketing-generated revenue improved between the July–December 2024 and July–December 2025 periods.                  |
